@@ -0,0 +1,22 @@
+---
+id: "n_1000_a556"
+type: "note"
+title: "flutter_agent_harness rework gotchas (pr-1648 round, 2026-10-17): (1) beyond the known auto-commit/merge-revert behavior, the bot also runs a HARD `git reset --hard origin/<branch>` on the rework checkout (reflog: \"reset: moving to origin/feat/1646-antistop\") — it wipes staged AND unstaged fixes (git checkout origin/main -- <file> alone is NOT durable; commit+push immediately after every restore, and re-verify edits survived before verifying tests). (2) The runner session restarts every ~30-90 min: the fa bash-job registry resets (old jobs \"never registered\"), .fah/bash_jobs logs vanish, and gitignored outputs/ (response.md, review_replies.json, review_replies/*) get WIPED — re-write them from context at the end, after the last restart if possible; long verification runs (>~10 min background OR foreground) get killed by these restarts — prefer short targeted tests locally and let the branch-push validation CI run the full suite (check `gh run list --branch <branch>` for the \"CI\" workflow on the pushed sha; it is the authoritative full-suite result)."
+author: "agent"
+date: "2026-10-17T02:31:56.234265Z"
+area: "project"
+topics: []
+source: "agent"
+accessCount: 0
+importance: 0.5
+tags: ["#note", "#source_agent", "git", "gotcha", "workflow", "auto-save-bot", "rework", "environment"]
+---
+
+
+# Note: n_1000_a556
+
+flutter_agent_harness rework gotchas (pr-1648 round, 2026-10-17): (1) beyond the known auto-commit/merge-revert behavior, the bot also runs a HARD `git reset --hard origin/<branch>` on the rework checkout (reflog: "reset: moving to origin/feat/1646-antistop") — it wipes staged AND unstaged fixes (git checkout origin/main -- <file> alone is NOT durable; commit+push immediately after every restore, and re-verify edits survived before verifying tests). (2) The runner session restarts every ~30-90 min: the fa bash-job registry resets (old jobs "never registered"), .fah/bash_jobs logs vanish, and gitignored outputs/ (response.md, review_replies.json, review_replies/*) get WIPED — re-write them from context at the end, after the last restart if possible; long verification runs (>~10 min background OR foreground) get killed by these restarts — prefer short targeted tests locally and let the branch-push validation CI run the full suite (check `gh run list --branch <branch>` for the "CI" workflow on the pushed sha; it is the authoritative full-suite result).
+
+**By:** [[agent]]
+**Date:** 2026-10-17T02:31:56.234265Z
+**Area:** [[project|project]]
